    "summary": "When a friendly unit destroys another unit, the friendly unit gains consecration. As your turn finishes, you may choose one objective in range of each of your units with that status, skipping your home objective and any already consecrated. The choice consecrates it, spends the unit’s status and puts an operation marker of yours in range of the selected objective.",
